  "body": "Note that support for dependency groups was added in poetry core [1.1.0](https://github.com/python-poetry/poetry-core/releases/tag/1.1.0a6).\r\n\r\nPoetry-core 1.0.8 rejects this syntax:\r\n\r\n```\r\nRuntimeError: The Poetry configuration is invalid:\r\n  - Additional properties are not allowed ('group' was unexpected\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhich unfortunately means that the poetry-core range given in https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/edf046ece7c14cd8f01a4e5ebcbeefac9e0b6717/pyproject.toml#L365-L372\r\n\r\ncan no longer build Synapse at the lower end of the version range.\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n- Move these into the `tool.poetry.dev-dependencies` section above, or\r\n- Bump the lower bound to >=1.1.0 and liaise with packagers, or\r\n- ??? something else?\r\n\r\nActions:\r\n- We should probably ensure something in CI tries to build a wheel using the oldest supported version of poetry-core\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @DMRobertson in https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/15265#discussion_r1163146699_\r\n            ",
